# Deny by default, then allow exactly what the site serves.
# Keeps the forensic reports, third-party reference copies, source GIF,
# font archives and working screenshots out of a public repo.
*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!servicos.html
!metodologia.html
!blog.html
!contato.html
!hikari-site.css
!hikari-site.js
!transition.js
!Geist-Mono-wght-400.woff2
!InstrumentSerif.woff2
!Switzer-400.woff2
!Switzer-500.woff2
!fonts/
!fonts/HikaSans-Regular.woff2
!fonts/HikaSans-Bold.woff2
!fonts/Onest-Variable.ttf
!.nojekyll
